#### routes side-effecting action intent through runtime control decisions

- Verify: routes side-effecting action intent through runtime control decisions
   - Expected: panel.action equals `start`
   - Expected: panel.status equals `planned`
   - Expected: panel.reason equals `live_executor_required`
   - Expected: panel.models_reason equals `probe_not_run`


